er":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o027a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-50bee17966dbf776f03c","layer":"original","quote":"曹公以江陵有军实〖4〗，恐先主据之；乃释辎重，轻军到襄阳。闻先主已过，曹公将精骑五千急追之；一日一夜行三百余里，及于当阳之长坂〖5〗。先主弃妻子，与诸葛亮、张飞、赵云等数十骑走〖6〗。曹公大获其人众辎重。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
